<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">01092026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>In Kaushambi district, in India's Uttar Pradesh, an explosion at a firecracker workshop killed at least eleven people... eight of them children.</s>
<s>The children didn't die on a production line — they died inside their own homes, which collapsed because the workshop sat metres away, deliberately kept small enough to fall below the licensing thresholds that trigger siting and storage rules.</s>
<s>Police say they've arrested the owner after what they describe as an encounter in Prayagraj, and the safety regime that failed here wasn't broken by one operator... it was designed around.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Washington brought Russia's finance minister, Anton Siluanov, back to the G20 finance table in Asheville, over explicit European objection, and European ministers walked out of the family photo in protest.</s>
<s>Isolation is what economists call a coordination good — it only works if every participant sustains it, so the defection of the largest member is worth more to Moscow than any individual sanction is worth to Kyiv.</s>
<s>Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent told Siluanov that no economic relief comes before the war ends, but the invitation had already been extended, and the guest list, not the warning, is what the room saw.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Italy has extended its suspension of Schengen free movement with Spain by another fifteen days, pushing border checks between two founding members of the European project into the middle of September.</s>
<s>Each renewal is individually legal and individually defensible, which is exactly how a temporary exception becomes permanent without anyone ever voting for it — the same ratchet France, Germany and Austria have already turned at other internal borders.</s>
<s>Spain reviews its own checks on September the seventh, and nobody in Rome or Brussels has named a condition under which the checks would end.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A prosecutor in Forsyth County, North Carolina, has charged a seventeen-year-old with murder for livestreaming the May attack that killed three worshippers at a San Diego mosque, and for distributing the attackers' writings.</s>
<s>The charge isn't for pulling a trigger — it's for producing and circulating the massacre as media, under a state aiding-and-abetting law that makes anyone who helps commit a crime as guilty as the person who commits it.</s>
<s>Since Christchurch, this class of attack has been built for replication, and the footage is the payload... so prosecutors are reaching for the distribution because distribution is what produces the next attacker.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>On the Tibetan side of a shared Himalayan river basin, a deadly flood has produced almost no record at all, while the same water downstream in Nepal has journalists, a rising public toll, and relief.</s>
<s>Flood forecasting in a transboundary basin is an information system before it's an engineering one — a downstream state can't model a surge whose headwater gauge readings are a state secret.</s>
<s>Everything known about the Tibetan toll comes through Chinese state media, and how much of it is documented, versus simply never counted, is a question nobody outside Beijing can currently answer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>On the sidelines of the summit in Bishkek, Narendra Modi told Vladimir Putin the war must end for humanity's sake — while Delhi remains one of the largest buyers of the discounted Russian crude that funds it.</s>
<s>That's not hypocrisy so much as arithmetic: India buys Russian oil, Western technology and Gulf security simultaneously, and each relationship subsidises its freedom of movement in the others.</s>
<s>Moscow and Delhi are targeting a hundred billion dollars in trade, which means the barrels are the leverage the sentence deliberately didn't use.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>United States Central Command says the rocket launchers it struck overnight on Iran's Larak island could have dispensed small naval mines — a weapon type nobody has publicly confirmed Iran fields.</s>
<s>Rocket-scattered mines would matter because they can be laid from land in minutes, skipping the ships and aircraft that normally give warning, and turning a clearance problem from days into weeks.</s>
<s>Every capability claim here comes from the striking party, verified by no one else, and roughly thirty vessels a night still transit Hormuz beneath it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An investigation by New Lines and the Syrian research group SIRAJ found that the Islamic State buried some forty-seven million dollars in gold and cash across Deir ez-Zor, and still draws on those caches to rebuild.</s>
<s>Buried gold can't be frozen, costs nothing to hold, and leaves none of the transfer records that a decade of financial tracing was built to follow.</s>
<s>Meanwhile in Damascus, Commander Mazloum Abdi has dissolved the Syrian Democratic Forces into Syria's defence ministry, with three Kurdish brigades now guarding their own cities... and a war many feared would follow simply never came.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The White House has named the vehicle that'll hold the American stake in Venezuela's oil reserves: a private company called North American Blue Energy Partners, in which the Pentagon takes thirty-five percent, and the State Department can buy a fifth of the output at cost.</s>
<s>A special-purpose company converts what would be a treaty into a commercial contract — moving it outside congressional ratification, outside public disclosure, and outside the arbitration record that governs Venezuelan expropriations.</s>
<s>Senator Jack Reed has objected, Exxon is re-entering the country after nineteen years on a sanctions licence rather than a contract, and almost nothing is publicly known about who owns the vehicle itself.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Australian home prices fell for a fifth consecutive month, new mortgage growth crawled to two-tenths of a percent in July, and the Reserve Bank still can't cut.</s>
<s>The reason sits eleven thousand kilometres away — Brent crude rose five point four percent in the month to August the twenty-fifth, and a central bank can't ease against an imported supply shock without validating it.</s>
<s>AMP expects a ten percent peak-to-trough fall, which means a household in Sydney is paying for the Strait of Hormuz through its mortgage rather than its fuel bill.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South African motorists face a petrol increase of one rand thirty-four a litre on Tuesday, even though the rand itself has strengthened.</s>
<s>South Africa's fuel-price formula converts global oil costs and the exchange rate directly into pump prices with no political discretion in between, and those prices then set minibus-taxi fares — the commute for the majority who don't own cars.</s>
<s>The state's fuel-price deficit is what's overriding the currency gain, so the strongest rand in months buys nothing at the pump.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Factory gauges across Asia rose in August, with China at fifty-one point five, Japan at fifty-four point nine, and South Korean exports up sixty-eight point seven percent, all driven by chips and hardware for artificial intelligence.</s>
<s>A purchasing managers' index is a diffusion index — it averages a booming segment against a flat one and reports the mean as health, which here blends a data-centre boom with ordinary manufacturing that isn't moving.</s>
<s>Export economies that spent a decade diversifying away from Western demand are re-concentrating on a handful of American hyperscalers, whose capital spending is the most cyclical money in the world.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Federal Trade Commission, joined by twenty-two states, has sued Amazon over twenty billion dollars it says advertisers were overcharged.</s>
<s>Regulators allege Amazon inserted an invented rival bid into its ad auctions, pushing each advertiser toward their own maximum price rather than the market's — a mechanism invisible from inside the auction.</s>
<s>The cost lands on small sellers who have to buy Amazon's ads to be seen on Amazon's shelves at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Nigeria's Akwa Ibom state, civil society groups are pressing the banks that finance oil extraction in Ibeno and Obolo, where communities say drilling has ruined farmland.</s>
<s>The argument extends accountability upstream from the driller to the financier, a doctrine that took decades to establish in tobacco and arms and is only now reaching African extraction.</s>
<s>The coalition wants Nigeria's central bank to tighten lending rules... which would make the country's own regulator, not a foreign court, the enforcement point.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The world's climate modelling groups have settled the scenario set for the seventh Coupled Model Intercomparison Project, and it puts warming by twenty-one hundred between one point six and three point three degrees.</s>
<s>That's the narrowest range in four generations of these exercises, but the crucial point is that scenarios are chosen rather than measured — a small international community decides which futures get simulated, and any future nobody runs is a future no government can cite.</s>
<s>Delegations negotiating loss and damage will argue against projections whose boundaries they had no part in specifying.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Japanese researchers tracked a hundred and twenty older adults across forty-six thousand seven hundred and twenty nights of sleep, and found each one-point gain in the regularity of their daily rhythm meant up to seventy percent higher odds of sharper cognition.</s>
<s>The new measure asks how much work it'd take to reshape one day's activity pattern into another's, rather than counting total hours — so two people with identical sleep duration and completely different rhythms no longer score the same.</s>
<s>It's a measurement argument from one national cohort, not yet a clinical finding, and measurement choices decide what counts as evidence in this enormous literature.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Mainz found that raindrops sliding down a coated surface build up to nine thousand volts, and that charge punches through the coating's insulation before the drop even reaches the metal.</s>
<s>Corrosion models for aircraft and bridge coatings omit this electrical mechanism entirely — they were built around chemistry and impact, not static.</s>
<s>Thicker coatings resisted the damage, but aircraft can't simply carry thicker paint, so the fix isn't obvious.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>At the Grand Canyon, a second hiker has died and about fifteen people remain unaccounted for after flash flooding, park officials said Monday.</s>
<s>Bare canyon rock sheds a storm's rainfall almost instantly, which is why trails the rain never touched can flood without warning from water that fell kilometres upstream.</s>
<s>The National Park Service has set no timeline for reopening the bridges, with more storms forecast.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Google has removed Manifest V2 extensions from the Chrome Web Store, uBlock Origin among them, ending a deprecation the company has always described as a security and performance migration.</s>
<s>State it as structure rather than motive: the firm earning most of its revenue from advertising also writes the extension interface that decides what an ad blocker may do, and the old interface let extensions inspect every request in their own code while the new one hands the browser a bounded rule list and shows the extension nothing.</s>
<s>Millions of users won't be told anything — their blocker will simply, quietly, stop working.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nvidia is putting three and a half billion dollars into Taiwan's MediaTek through convertible bonds, its largest direct investment ever outside the United States.</s>
<s>A convertible is capital today without control today, and control later at a price fixed now — which is how a dominant firm buys an option on the ecosystem forming around its own technology.</s>
<s>Taiwan's chip sector grows further entangled with American capital at a moment when that entanglement is both its protection and its exposure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Analysts at CoinDesk say wallets linked to North Korea moved more than thirty million dollars through the Hyperliquid exchange, reaching platforms including Kraken and LBank, while regulators weigh licensing it.</s>
<s>The entire trail sits on a public ledger, fully visible to any researcher who looks, and no protocol rule can block a transaction that's otherwise valid.</s>
<s>Visibility, it turns out, isn't the same thing as enforcement.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Google researchers have traced a proxy network called Popanet running through two million devices, many of them cheap streaming boxes that ship with an unauthenticated open root port.</s>
<s>Clean residential addresses are the product — they're sold to criminals who need traffic that looks like it comes from an ordinary home, for fraud and for denial-of-service attacks.</s>
<s>The security firm Plume is urging owners to disconnect the boxes, though most owners have no way of knowing they own one.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>And mathematics is splitting over artificial intelligence, after a Fields Medalist joined OpenAI within hours of winning the discipline's highest honour.</s>
<s>Mathematics is the one field whose claims verify end to end — a proof either checks in a verifier or it doesn't — which makes it the cleanest available test of whether these systems contribute knowledge or merely plausible text.</s>
<s>The automation is landing first on exactly the routine problems that train graduate students, and journals and referees still have to decide what an AI-assisted proof even is... in sha'Allah with more care than speed.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>